module desktop

# Main components
Desktop 1.0 Desktop.qml
Widget 1.0 Widget.qml
Face 1.0 Face.qml
Picker 1.0 Picker.qml
Tray 1.0 Tray.qml
Inspector 1.0 Inspector.qml
ThemeSwatch 1.0 ThemeSwatch.qml

# Faces are resolved internally via relative imports (Face.qml -> "./faces"
# and "./faces/analogue") -- they are not part of the desktop module's public
# QML API and are deliberately not registered here. There is no standalone
# "ClockModern"/"ClockAnalogue" component in impasto: the modern clock face
# lives inline in faces/Squares.qml, faces/Wides.qml, faces/Larges.qml and
# faces/Bands.qml (dispatched by module id), and the analogue one is
# faces/analogue/ClockFace.qml (dispatched by faces/analogue/Analogue.qml).
